{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sportvida CyberDash</strong> is a <strong>VR running game</strong> that delivers both stress relief and thrilling challenges. Set in a high-speed, futuristic world of light and technology, you\u2019ll embark on an intense adventure where <strong>sprinting, dodging, and smashing obstacles</strong> offer an unparalleled sense of release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136070/extras/LIV_3.gif?t=1744377335\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> In this breathtaking and luminous future world, your mission is to race to the finish line in the shortest time possible, breaking through anything that stands in your way. The game\u2019s stunning visual effects, combined with its high-energy soundscape, immerse you in a sensation of speed and power like never before. Sportvida CyberDash is not just about exercise\u2014it\u2019s an exhilarating experience that lets you challenge yourself while unwinding in a fast-paced, visually stunning environment. <strong>Whether you're a fitness enthusiast or simply seeking stress relief, this game will help you find your rhythm and rediscover joy in movement.</strong>  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136070/extras/KeyFeatures.png?t=1744377335\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udca53 Unique Game Modes</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Race Mode</strong> \u2013 Pure running with no speed limits and no obstacles\u2014push yourself to the max and challenge your top speed!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136070/extras/RaceMode.gif?t=1744377335\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dodge Mode</strong> \u2013 Dodge randomly generated obstacles for a unique experience every time\u2014test your reflexes!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136070/extras/DodgeMode_1.gif?t=1744377335\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strike Mode</strong> \u2013 Sprint when the path is clear, strike or dodge when obstacles appear\u2014balance challenge and endurance!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136070/extras/_Satisfying_Strikes_2.gif?t=1744377335\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0fStress-Free Running:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the light-speed world of SPORTVIDA, run freely and smash through obstacles! It\u2019s the ultimate way to relieve stress, <strong>challenging yourself while enjoying the thrill of high-speed excitement.</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136070/extras/StressFreeRunning.gif?t=1744377335\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udcaaCasual Fitness:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sweat it out in-game and make fitness fun! <strong>Remember to warm up before starting, grab your towel, and get ready for an exciting workout challenge!</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136070/extras/WorkoutRecords.gif?t=1744377335\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3136070?t=1744377335","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136070/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744377335","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136070/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744377335","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136070/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744377335","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description